        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">In plain terms, it is Meta's own recognition of the agency. It is a useful check that an agency is known to Meta. It carries no guarantee of results for your account and does not change what you pay for ads, which is why we pair it with a profit target and weekly reporting you can check.</p>
      </div>
